 "_": "메뉴·힌트·고지문·크레딧 (비압축 영역 안 rzip 블록)",
 "part": 16,
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": 961,
   "width": 109,
   "subs": [
    {
     "id": 3253,
     "bytes": 20,
     "en": "The Catapult . . .\nº",
     "ko": "캐터펄트. . .\nº"
    },
    {
     "id": 3254,
     "bytes": 29,
     "en": "Let's see now,\nUse ± to aim\nº",
     "ko": "어디 보자,\n± 로 조준\nº"
    },
    {
     "id": 3255,
     "bytes": 17,
     "en": "and ® to fire.\n\nº",
     "ko": "® 로 발사.\n\nº"
    },
    {
     "id": 3256,
     "bytes": 25,
     "en": "That seems\nsimple enough.",
     "ko": "간단하군."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 962,
   "width": 103,
   "subs": [
    {
     "id": 3257,
     "bytes": 37,
     "en": "Hit ®\nYou ´²µ³ fool!\nNow press ¨. . .",
     "ko": "® 명중\n이 ´²µ³ 바보!\n이제 ¨. . ."
    },
    {
     "id": 3258,
     "bytes": 17,
     "en": "It lets you piss!",
     "ko": "오줌 눌 수 있다!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 963,
   "width": 192,
   "subs": [
    {
     "id": 3259,
     "bytes": 79,
     "en": "\nOh, I can't\nseem to get\nany further . . .\nI'm sure there\nwas something . . .\nº",
     "ko": "\n오, 더는\n못 가겠는데. . .\n분명 뭔가\n있었는데. . ."
    },
    {
     "id": 3260,
     "bytes": 59,
     "en": "Ah yes, now\nI remember !\nHold ® down and I\n\nshould crouch\nº",
     "ko": "아 맞다, 이제\n생각났다!\n® 를 누르면\n\n웅크린다.\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 3261,
     "bytes": 65,
     "en": "Now then,\nwhat was it?\nOh yeah . . .\nPress ¨ to jump\nextra high\nº",
     "ko": "그래서,\n뭐였더라?\n아 맞다. . .\n¨ 누르면\n높이 뛴다\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 3262,
     "bytes": 128,
     "en": "Then ¨ again to do that\nfunny helicoptery tail thing.\nNow that makes me hover.\nHmm . . .  I should easily\nget across that gap.\nº",
     "ko": "¨ 를 또 누르면\n꼬리로 헬리콥터처럼\n뜬다.\n그러면 공중에 뜬다.\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 3263,
     "bytes": 44,
     "en": "Um, are you sure\nyou've got that?\n¨ Yes © No",
     "ko": "진짜 알아들었나?\n¨ 예 © 아니오"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 964,
   "width": 205,
   "subs": [
    {
     "id": 3264,
     "bytes": 123,
     "en": "Hang on . . . \nThere is something\nmissing here. Didn't I have a . . .\nAh . . .\nTry pressing ©\nand see what\nthat does. . .\nº",
     "ko": "잠깐. . .\n뭔가 빠졌는데.\n안 그런가?\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 3265,
     "bytes": 44,
     "en": "Um, are you sure\nyou've got that?\n¨ Yes © No",
     "ko": "진짜 알아들었나?\n¨ 예 © 아니오"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 965,
   "width": 173,
   "subs": [
    {
     "id": 3266,
     "bytes": 130,
     "en": "\nAnd if I'm a lot\nmore confident, then\nI should be able to\nswim underwater now.\nHmmmm . . .\n How would I do that?\nLets see . . .\nº",
     "ko": "\n자신 있으면\n더 잘할 수 있을\n텐데.\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 3267,
     "bytes": 38,
     "en": "Press © and that\nshould submerge me.\nº",
     "ko": "© 누르면\n물속으로 들어간다.\nº"
    },
    {
     "id": 3268,
     "bytes": 57,
     "en": "Then, once I'm underwater,\nhold down © to\n make me swim\nº",
     "ko": "물속에 들어가면\n© 를 계속 눌러\n헤엄친다.\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 3269,
     "bytes": 53,
     "en": "Point ±\nin the direction you\nwant to go.\nThat's it!\nº",
     "ko": "± 로\n가고 싶은 쪽을\n가리켜라.\n끝!\n"
    },
    {
     "id": 3270,
     "bytes": 44,
     "en": "Um, are you sure\nyou've got that?\n¨ Yes © No",
     "ko": "진짜 알아들었나?\n¨ 예 © 아니오"
    }
   ]
  },
